     * <p>For a list of possible values see <a
     * href="http://java.sun.com/j2se/1.5.0/docs/guide/intl/encoding.doc.html">http://java.sun.com/j2se/1.5.0/docs/guide/intl/encoding.doc.html</a>.
     * Defaults to UTF-8.</p>
     */
